  "content": {
    "id": "p35-q9-root",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "9",
    "prompt": "When it is 3:03:52 p.m. (the last two digits indicate seconds) in Brisbane, the time is 7:03:52 a.m. on the same day in Madrid. We say that Brisbane is ahead of Madrid. What is the time difference between the two cities?",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "8 hours",
      "worked": "From 7:03:52 a.m. to 12:03:52 p.m. is 5 hours. From 12:03:52 p.m. to 3:03:52 p.m. is another 3 hours.\n\n$$\\begin{aligned}\\text{Time difference}&=5+3\\text{ hours}\\\\\\text{Time difference}&=8\\text{ hours}\\end{aligned}$$\n\nBrisbane is 8 hours ahead of Madrid.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
